{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06688","headline":"荥阳马氏二子 · 储光羲","name":"荥阳马氏二子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣君封太岳，十月建行旃。\n辇路开千里，寒云霁九天。\n故人多侍从，二子留伊川。\n河兖冰初合，关城月屡圆。\n暝过荥水上，闻说郑卿贤。\n材蔽行人右，名居东里先。\n制岩开别业，桑柘亦依然。\n待至金园侧，相将居一廛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06688.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06688","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}